WEBVTT

00:00:20.522 --> 00:00:23.002
This is the place.

00:00:23.046 --> 00:00:25.396
Oh, yes.

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:29.052
This place
has known magic.

00:00:35.841 --> 00:00:37.887
Sir!In order to gain passage

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.323
payment must be made.

00:00:39.367 --> 00:00:43.197
Payment intended
to weaken any intruder.

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:46.591
You should've let me, sir.No, Harry.

00:00:46.635 --> 00:00:50.204
Your blood's much more precious
than mine.

00:00:56.645 --> 00:00:58.647
[RUMBLING]

00:01:11.573 --> 00:01:13.879
Voldemort will not
have made it easy

00:01:13.923 --> 00:01:16.230
to discover his hiding place.

00:01:16.273 --> 00:01:20.103
He will have put certain
defenses in position.

00:01:22.279 --> 00:01:24.020
Careful.

00:01:30.069 --> 00:01:32.071
[♪♪♪]

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:48.479
DUMBLEDORE:
There it is.

00:01:49.828 --> 00:01:52.918
The only question is,
how do we get there?

00:02:08.934 --> 00:02:10.936
[BUBBLING]

00:02:14.592 --> 00:02:17.029
If you would, Harry.

00:03:03.902 --> 00:03:06.818
Do you think the Horcrux
is in there, sir?

00:03:06.862 --> 00:03:09.604
Oh, yes.

00:03:09.647 --> 00:03:11.649
[♪♪♪]

00:03:19.396 --> 00:03:21.137
It has to be drunk.

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:24.140
All of it
has to be drunk.

00:03:24.183 --> 00:03:28.231
You remember the conditions
on which I brought you with me?

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:31.103
This potion might paralyze me.

00:03:31.147 --> 00:03:32.975
Might make me forget
why I'm here.

00:03:33.018 --> 00:03:37.022
Might cause me so much pain
that I beg for relief.

00:03:37.066 --> 00:03:39.242
You are not to indulge
these requests.

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:40.635
It's your job, Harry,

00:03:40.678 --> 00:03:42.941
to make sure I keep drinking
this potion.

00:03:42.985 --> 00:03:45.553
Even if you have to force it
down my throat.

00:03:45.596 --> 00:03:48.207
Understood?Why can't I drink it, sir?

00:03:48.251 --> 00:03:51.733
Because I am much older,
much cleverer,

00:03:51.776 --> 00:03:53.909
and much less valuable.

00:03:57.478 --> 00:04:00.045
Your good health, Harry.

00:04:15.104 --> 00:04:17.193
Professor.

00:04:19.195 --> 00:04:20.239
Professor!

00:04:20.283 --> 00:04:22.285
[DUMBLEDORE GROANING]

00:04:26.942 --> 00:04:28.726
Harry.

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:31.425
Professor,
can you hear me?

00:04:32.513 --> 00:04:33.862
Professor.

00:04:35.777 --> 00:04:38.606
[DUMBLEDORE GROANING]

00:04:49.138 --> 00:04:50.531
No. Don't.

00:04:50.574 --> 00:04:52.924
You have to keep drinking,
like you said. Remember?

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:04.022
Stop.It will stop. It will stop,

00:05:04.066 --> 00:05:06.285
but only if you keep drinking.

00:05:06.329 --> 00:05:08.200
Please, don't make me.

00:05:08.244 --> 00:05:10.942
I'm sorry, sir.Please.

00:05:10.986 --> 00:05:13.379
Kill me. Kill me!No!

00:05:15.164 --> 00:05:16.382
DUMBLEDORE:
It's my fault.

00:05:17.906 --> 00:05:19.255
It's all my fault.

00:05:21.431 --> 00:05:22.911
It's my fault.

00:05:22.954 --> 00:05:26.305
Just one more, sir.
One more, and then I promise--

00:05:26.349 --> 00:05:29.308
I promise I'll do
what you say.

00:05:29.352 --> 00:05:31.310
I promise.
No.

00:05:32.137 --> 00:05:34.226
Please.

00:05:57.598 --> 00:05:59.469
Harry.

00:06:06.215 --> 00:06:08.304
Water.

00:06:08.347 --> 00:06:09.566
Water.

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:11.525
Water.

00:06:17.792 --> 00:06:19.837
You did it, sir.

00:06:19.881 --> 00:06:21.491
Look.

00:06:22.753 --> 00:06:25.930
Harry.

00:06:25.974 --> 00:06:27.541
Water.

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:30.848
Aguamenti.

00:06:30.892 --> 00:06:33.198
DUMBLEDORE:
Water.

